use the following command to run the ansible playbook

ansible-playbook -i hosts create_dummy_interface.yml --ask-become-pass




to configure ssh
for host in `cat hosts |grep 10`; do ssh -oStrictHostKeyChecking=no ${host} uptime; done
for host in `cat hosts |grep 10`; do ssh-copy-id ${host}; done
for host in `cat hosts |grep 10`; do ssh ${host} uptime; done
